---
// Quiz figure for Post 3 set 07: thin 3-level Ask ladder for MP vs LO calculation.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq03mp">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 195" role="img" aria-label="Thin Ask order book: Ask 1 500 shares at 25,050; Ask 2 500 shares at 25,200; Ask 3 1,000 shares at 25,600.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Resting sellers (Ask side) during continuous trading</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các lệnh Bán đang treo (bên Ask) trong phiên liên tục</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="172" height="126" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="102" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">Ask 1</text>
    <text x="102" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">25,050 đ</text>
    <text x="102" y="138" text-anchor="middle">500 shares</text>

    <rect x="204" y="44" width="172" height="126" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="290" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">Ask 2</text>
    <text x="290" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">25,200 đ</text>
    <text x="290" y="138" text-anchor="middle">500 shares</text>

    <rect x="392" y="44" width="172" height="126" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="478" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m qfig-red">Ask 3</text>
    <text x="478" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t qfig-red">25,600 đ</text>
    <text x="478" y="138" text-anchor="middle">1,000 shares</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq03mp { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq03mp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq03mp text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-t { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq03mp .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
